# Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx counts each Phyrexian symbol and each monocolored hybrid symbol with a generic half once toward devotion
# to its color (CR 700.5, 107.4e, 107.4f): Wildgrowth Archaic's {2/G}{2/G} is devotion to green 2, and Norn's Annex's
# {3}{W/P}{W/P} devotion to white 2 (its {3} counts for nothing), whether a {W/P} was paid with white mana or with life.
# Nykthos adds {G}{G} on turn 3 and {W}{W} on turn 5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx
Mox Emerald
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Wildgrowth Archaic
Norn's Annex
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Wildgrowth Archaic.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Norn's Annex.Cast
# The first {W/P} paid with 2 life, the second with white mana.
Bot1.Modes(1)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx.Activate(Ability: {2}; Color: Green)
? Bot1.Mana = {G}{G}
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald#2.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx.Activate(Ability: {2}; Color: White)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
Bot1.Choose(Pay mana)
? Bot1.Mana = {W}{W}

